---
/** Settings: one question for automatic resume, and the time format. */
import ZedWindow from "../zed/ZedWindow.astro";
import { version } from "../../../../package.json";
---

<figure class="scene not-content">
  <ZedWindow title="Split the scheduler" height={380}>
    <div class="zed-form">
      <header>Input Requested by Claude Agent</header>
      <div class="q">Agent Rewake {version} settings.</div>
      <div class="f">
        <span>Automatic resume after usage limits</span>
        <div class="radio">On, even when permissions are bypassed</div>
        <div class="radio">On, except when permissions are bypassed</div>
        <div class="radio on">Ask when a new thread opens</div>
        <div class="radio">Off</div>
      </div>
      <div class="f">
        <span>Time format</span>
        <div class="radio on">12-hour (3:19 PM)</div>
        <div class="radio">24-hour (15:19)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="actions"><span class="zed-btn ok"><i>✓</i> Submit</span><span class="zed-btn no"><i>✕</i> Decline</span><span class="zed-btn">Cancel</span></div>
    </div>
  </ZedWindow>
  <figcaption>
    <span><b>Rewake → Settings…</b>: one question for automatic resume (what new threads do, and whether threads that bypass permissions are included), and the time format.</span>
    <span class="rw-tag">Illustration</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
